{"id":"9774a30174f5664c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-erdos-rado-higher.md","title":"Higher Erdős-Rado Theorem","display":"thm-erdos-rado-higher — Higher Erdős-Rado Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-erdos-rado-higher","aliases":["58-thm-erdos-rado-higher"],"display":"thm-erdos-rado-higher — Higher Erdős-Rado Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-partition]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-beth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-erdos-rado-higher"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-erdos-rado-higher</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-erdos-rado-higher — Higher Erdős-Rado Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebc39f41721b42e4\" href=\"?note=ebc39f41721b42e4\" title=\"58-df-partition\">58-df-partition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52f8d393a9bbb21e\" href=\"?note=52f8d393a9bbb21e\" title=\"58-df-beth\">58-df-beth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,n\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,n\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth_n(\\kappa)\">\\(\\beth_n(\\kappa)\\)</span> is the generalized beth hierarchy from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52f8d393a9bbb21e\" href=\"?note=52f8d393a9bbb21e\" title=\"58-df-beth\">58-df-beth</a>, and the arrow is the relation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ebc39f41721b42e4\" href=\"?note=ebc39f41721b42e4\" title=\"58-df-partition\">58-df-partition</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}erdos\\text{-}rado\\text{-}higher}\\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land n\\in\\omega\\to\\beth_n(\\kappa)^+\\longrightarrow(\\kappa^+)^{n+1}_{\\kappa}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}erdos\\text{-}rado\\text{-}higher}\\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land n\\in\\omega\\to\\beth_n(\\kappa)^+\\longrightarrow(\\kappa^+)^{n+1}_{\\kappa}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The exponent is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> and the number of colors is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This gives bounds on partition relations for higher exponents.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-partition","status":"resolved","id":"ebc39f41721b42e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-partition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-beth","status":"resolved","id":"52f8d393a9bbb21e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-beth]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-beth","status":"resolved","id":"52f8d393a9bbb21e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beth_n(\\kappa)$ is the generalized beth hierarchy from [[58-df-beth]], and the arrow is the relation from [[58-df-partition]].","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-partition","status":"resolved","id":"ebc39f41721b42e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beth_n(\\kappa)$ is the generalized beth hierarchy from [[58-df-beth]], and the arrow is the relation from [[58-df-partition]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\leq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\beth_n(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}erdos\\text{-}rado\\text{-}higher}\\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land n\\in\\omega\\to\\beth_n(\\kappa)^+\\longrightarrow(\\kappa^+)^{n+1}_{\\kappa}.","display":true},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":919,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-erdos-rado-higher.md|58-thm-erdos-rado-higher]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["ebc39f41721b42e4","5fb1c2241d1943d1","52f8d393a9bbb21e"]}